Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:22.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《鬼娃回魂》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现那个杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the Strangler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在华比和范拜仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wabash and Van Buren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.47,0:01:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.56,0:01:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 去范那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, get the van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 别丢下我 天啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, Eddie, don't leave me! God, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧 雷 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it up, Ray. It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 我要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I'm dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了没 你这个杂种？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear this, you son of a bitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会那样对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you for it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会抓住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.89,0:03:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会抓住艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna get Eddie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:04:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但我要找个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I gotta find somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta find somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我力量吧 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有朋友 没有人会和我一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no friends. No one will play with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a friend in need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 振作点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, cheer up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Good Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚从公仔俱乐部来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just come from the Good Guy Clubhouse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都会是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be your friend to the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,会吗？你意思是你现在也已是我朋友了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will? You mean you'll be my friend now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidey-ho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 公仔们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, good guys, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们今天的公仔秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's our Good Guys show for today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't go away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们有很重要的公仔信息给大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we've got a very important Good Guy message just for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 公仔们 孩子 我有一些新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Good Guys. Boy, have I got news for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以拥有自己的公仔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can have your very own Good Guy doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在自家的电视里体验所有的冒险经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have all the adventures we have on TV in your very own home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,公仔们 说三句不同的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Guys say three different sentences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你跟我们说话时 我们甚至会闭上眼睛和转过头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We even turn our heads and blink our eyes when you talk to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 奥斯卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Oscar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是奥斯卡 我会是你永远的朋友 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Oscar, and I'm your friend to the end. Hidey-ho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个公仔都有他自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Good Guy has a name all his own, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他才能成为你最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he can be your very own best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要记得跟你爸妈说你要一个公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So remember to tell Mom and Dad you want a Good Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好在你生日或任何节日的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect for birthdays or just any old time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 你还可以买任何公仔附件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, you can buy all of our Good Guy accessories, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吧 奥斯卡？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, Oscar? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此独一无二的经历由「好玩伴」带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought to you exclusively by Play Pals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是公仔还有其它好玩具的制作人\N{\fnArial\fs30}makers of Good Guys and other fine toys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在芝加哥范围内的玩具店来买吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found in toy stores throughout the greater Chicago area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 起床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:09:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 起床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起床 妈咪 起床 - 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wake up, Mommy. Wake up. - Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点了 安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it, Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,6：30 现在才是早上6：30\N{\fnArial\fs30}6:30. It's only 6:30 in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天外面天气很好 看到了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's a beautiful day outside. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt certainly is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你起来多久了 小寿星？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been up, birthday boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在床上就已帮你弄好早餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made you breakfast in bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的？噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did? Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 它看起来很美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this looks just excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我会告诉你那是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟一点再吃这些东西 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I eat this just a little later, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我先给你一个超级生日礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, I gotta give you your super-duper, birthday tummy-gummy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这边 过来这边 过来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是它 你今年多大了？ - 两岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's one. How many years old are you today? - Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, pumpkin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我现在可以打开我的礼物吗 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Can we open my presents now, Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrific!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 芝加哥 现在开始播报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Chicago. Leading off at this hour, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·李·雷 声名狼籍的杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Lee Ray, the notorious Lake Shore Strangler was shot and killed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上3点前在华比街被枪杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}shortly before 3:00 a.m. this morning on Wabash Avenue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以先打开他吗 妈咪？我可以吗 我可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I open this first, Mommy? Can I, can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你为什么不先看那个小一点的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, don't you want to start with the smaller one first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 觉得怎么样？你很需要这些衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you think? You need these clothes so badly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它们还好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I think they're gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.82,0:10:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需剪去几英寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just have to take them up just a couple of inches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.12,0:10:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 你想要一些玩具 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know. You want some toys, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是讨人厌的破旧衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not boring old clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the other one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一个配套的公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a Good Guy to go with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you do, Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个月因为事先不知道就没来得及凑钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't know about it in time this month to save up for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯伦 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Karen. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你想买给安迪的那个公仔吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that doll that you wanted for Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 100块的那个？ - 是的 公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one that costs 100 bucks? - Yeah, the Good Guy doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这商店后面有一个小贩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a peddler in the alley behind the store, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.66,0:11:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他可能有那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think he's got one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？为什么小贩会有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What would a peddler be doing with a doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,管那么多干什么？你买不买？我觉得很划算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares? Would you grab your purse and come on? We can get a deal on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能离开柜台啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't just leave my counter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想不想要啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want the damn doll or don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然要 - 那快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course I do. - Well, then, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢点 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 给她看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, show her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公仔吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is it a Good Guy or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt is. lt is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you want for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十块\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最多10块 - 30块\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 10 and not a penny more. - 30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你开玩笑吧？那玩意不值30块\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you kidding? That thing is not worth $30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 不买走人 会有人买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough. Take it or leave it. Somebody else will buy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我买 - 凯伦 这太贵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take it. - Karen, it's too much money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不贵 你不知道安迪有多想要这个公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't. You have no idea how much Andy wants this doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道它是不是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't even know if the damn thing works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 女士 希望它能给你和你的孩子带来快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, lady. May it bring you and your kid a lot of joy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hold on, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道这鬼东西是不是偷的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know the damn thing isn't stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.13,0:12:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是你偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal this yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我是不是跟他约会过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I dated him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们要回去工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We gotta get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪肯定会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy's gonna love it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利夫人 你顺道过来真好 玩得很开心吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Barclay, so nice of you to drop by. Have a nice break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 克利斯威尔先生 我们只离开了一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mr. Criswell. I was only gone for a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,通融一点吧 克利斯威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a heart, Criswell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是到楼下帮她儿子买一件生日礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just downstairs buying her little boy a birthday present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在休息时间干这事 彼得森小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have specified break times for activities like that, Miss Peterson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫尔太太病了 我们又缺人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Howe has taken sick, and we're shorthanded tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你代替一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to fill in for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 1小时内我得去日托中心接我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I have to pick up my son at the day care center in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这是紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, this is an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我来代替她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. I'll take over for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得森小姐 你在鞋柜那边干活 而不是珠宝柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Peterson, you work in shoes, not in jewelry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll just simply have to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在5点离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can take off at 5:00, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但7点时要赶回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'll have to be back at 7:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我儿子生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my son's birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利夫人 你对这份工作还满意吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Barclay, are you happy with your job here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.89,0:13:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么我建议你 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then I suggest that… - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很扫兴 不是吗 华特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill out, would you, Walter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你照顾安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of Andy for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛吉 你不能再这样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, you can't do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 这会是几个月来最重要的约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be silly. It'll be the hottest date I've had in months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.73,0:13:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法想像为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.91,0:13:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,公仔们要在电视上出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Guys are on TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一些更好的东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I may have something better for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是普通的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't groceries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.85,0:14:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是公仔 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Good Guy! I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd get me one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,演示下它是怎么玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me how he works, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是安迪 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Andy. What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是恰奇 我会是你永远的朋友 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Chucky, and I'm your friend to the end. Hidey-ho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 它真有趣 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! He's something, isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mom, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你就是这样办事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's how you build things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.23,0:14:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 WDOL的最新插播报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. WDOL with a late breaking report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:15:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪·卡普托 查尔斯·李·雷的帮凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Caputo, repeated accomplice of Charles Lee Ray, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚从米其干大街附近逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has just escaped the Michigan Avenue precinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细情况将在9点下次播报\N{\fnArial\fs30}More details to follow on the news at 9:00 next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 恰奇 你没看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chucky, you're not watching me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 想玩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wanna play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 该上床了 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's time for bed, Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生 我以前从没见过这个小无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. Never saw the little swab before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 恰奇 我们该准备睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Chucky. We have to get ready to go to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有逃票 古先生带我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a stowaway. Mr. Ghoo brought me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,苹果先生是哪位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who might Mr. Apple be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛吉阿姨 恰奇想看9点的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt Maggie, Chucky wants to watch the 9:00 news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.49,0:15:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, kid, off we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.79,0:15:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 走咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too. Off we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去刷牙然后睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's brush your teeth and under the covers with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗？同意吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Agreed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了 就大叫一声 我才可以开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yell when you're ready for me to tuck you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 恰奇 想看看我的房间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chucky, want to see my room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你在刷牙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, are you brushing your teeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.05,0:16:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 玛吉阿姨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Aunt Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是9点新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, Action News at 9:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天在华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln Washington today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:16:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mayor replied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会仔细研究国会所裁决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he would study the congressional findings carefully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会考虑一些团体犯罪问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have the commission on gang-related violence issue recommendations to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,交回给你 史提夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to you, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.83,0:17:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 特里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方已澄清了一些事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other news, police have now clarified the information{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于艾迪·卡普托的逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding the escape of Eddie Caputo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方宣称他躲过了警方的追捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities say that Caputo managed to elude his captors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他从监狱被送去法院的途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}while being transferred onto a prison bus on his way to court. Of course…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 先生 关于这个你想说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, mister, what do you have to say about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？当我要你做啥的时候你必须听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you have to learn that when I say something, I mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我干了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what did I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.65,0:17:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打开电视并把恰奇放到它前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turning the TV on and putting Chucky in front of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我说你该上床睡觉的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I told you it was time to go to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是？那是恰奇干的咯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no? What did Chucky do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到起居室 自己打开电视？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk into the living room and turn it on all by himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你干的吗 恰奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do that, Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 够了 现在盖上被子 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, stop it. Now, come on, under the covers. Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是阿姨\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Auntie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖上被子 别再说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under the covers and not another word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并没有把恰奇放到电视机前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't put Chucky in front of the TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 行吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 宝贝 生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, baby, and happy birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.23,0:18:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 玛吉阿姨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Aunt Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过如果你看新闻的话 她会抓狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you she'd be mad at you if you watched the news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你得去参加表演了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid you weren't going to show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,事故太严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad about the accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 爸爸告诉我们他们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Papa told us they just found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是从什么地方听来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have heard it somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好久没见你了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen you in so long, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们能不能一起走走 或者干点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, couldn't we take a little walk, or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你很久没有呼吸过新鲜空气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt looks as though you haven't had a breath of fresh air in days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 散步？ - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A walk? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的空气对你有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The air outside will do you good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外还可以促进你的食欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you'll work up an appetite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 珍尼丝 要下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Janice, surely it's going to rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:19:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据有无起诉事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on whether there's an indictment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他们并不总是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they don't always…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did that happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 没事吧？安迪怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. How's it going? How's Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还会有谁？没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who else would it be? ls something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.77,0:22:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.81,0:22:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来不像没事的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure? You don't sound like everything's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.15,0:22:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是晚上一个人有一点点焦虑不安 你明白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just had a bit of the alone-at-night willies. You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.86,0:22:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你就别担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, would you stop worrying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你能否帮我踹克里斯韦尔一脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give Criswell a kick in the pants for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.66,0:22:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 玛吉 真是很感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, Maggie. Thank you for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是我的挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a real pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.29,0:22:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 帮我吻一下安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Give Andy a kiss for me, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见 拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我究竟怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快给自己吓死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scaring myself half to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.58,0:24:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,移走那路障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from this barricade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.41,0:24:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,挪到后面去 没什么好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move it back. There's nothing to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.33,0:24:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把警戒线移后点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's move this police line back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧 大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on home, folks, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在六楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was on the sixth floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.86,0:24:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 小姐 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, what do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.87,0:24:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.79,0:24:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.63,0:24:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.30,0:25:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.34,0:25:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.63,0:25:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.35,0:25:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.14,0:25:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太高兴了 刚才太可怕了当我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm so glad. I got so scared when I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.85,0:25:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？玛吉呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Where's Maggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.60,0:25:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她出了点了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.90,0:25:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外？什么意外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accident? What kind of an accident?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.65,0:25:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利太太 我是迈克·诺里斯探员 调查谋杀案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Barclay, I'm Detective Mike Norris, Homicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.86,0:25:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能和你去外面谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I talk to you out in the hall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.03,0:25:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？玛吉出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's happened to Maggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.08,0:25:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.13,0:25:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看 巴克利太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mrs. Barclay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.18,0:25:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.93,0:25:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得森小姐死了 巴克利太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Peterson's dead, Mrs. Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.85,0:25:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.98,0:25:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从厨房的窗口摔下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She fell from your kitchen window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.19,0:26:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.28,0:26:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.53,0:26:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.33,0:26:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 玛吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.33,0:26:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你检查那边了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you check over here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 玛吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.55,0:26:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是些什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any idea what these are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.97,0:26:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们好像是一些脚印 是吧？很小的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look like footprints, don't they? Very small footprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.23,0:26:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想暗示什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you implying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.48,0:26:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.11,0:26:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪跑到柜子上会干些啥呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Andy be doing up on the counter, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.07,0:26:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 另外\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Besides, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已查过他的柜子 他的鞋对不上这些脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already checked his closet. None of his shoes matched these prints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.78,0:26:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪？妈咪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy? Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.79,0:26:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇想知道情况怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky wanted to know what was going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.83,0:26:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 我要你去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, I want you to go to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.96,0:26:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和警探现在很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The detective and I are very busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Mom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.71,0:27:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.25,0:27:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.09,0:27:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脚上是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got on your feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.84,0:27:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,公仔运动鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Guy PJ sneakers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 过来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.43,0:27:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看看它的底部吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see the bottoms of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.93,0:27:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.10,0:27:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这 那是把枪 那是牛仔帽吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. There's a gun. Is that a cowboy hat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.44,0:27:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 快上床 我马上替你盖被子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, get into bed. I'll be in in a minute to tuck you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.69,0:27:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 妈妈 - 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But, Mom… - Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何这么对安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you treating Andy like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.12,0:27:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了不知道那里为何有脚印 他就是不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he says he doesn't know how those footprints got there, then he doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.75,0:27:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利太太 确实有人留下脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mrs. Barclay, somebody made those footprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.79,0:27:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是安迪会是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not Andy, then who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:27:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 而且我也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, and I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.92,0:27:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我的好朋友刚刚发生意外惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that I've just lost my best friend tonight to a horrible accident{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟儿子独处一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I would like some time alone with my son, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.42,0:27:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我一样伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}who I'm sure is just as upset about this as I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.59,0:27:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Sorry. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上叫我的同事离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll clear everybody out of here right away. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.56,0:28:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们 好了吗？走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, you done? Let's go. Chop-chop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.48,0:28:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, everybody. Out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.69,0:28:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,收队了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's clear this up over here. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.65,0:28:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.82,0:28:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 锡德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.95,0:28:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的鞋为什么这么重要吗 恰奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think was so important about my sneakers, Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.75,0:28:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不清楚 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know either, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.02,0:28:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你发现了那些脚印的任何情况 请告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me know if you find out anything about those footprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.52,0:28:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.15,0:28:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 我知道当时谁在厨房柜台那 我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, I know who was on the kitchen counter. I know, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.82,0:28:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪 我觉得我 - 谁 安迪？是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy, I thought I… - Who, Andy? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.11,0:28:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.86,0:28:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的公仔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.24,0:28:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的故事到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, that's enough stories for tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在回去睡觉 听到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on, back to bed. Now I mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Mom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.42,0:29:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又怎么了？ - 你在叫我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Are you gonna call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.09,0:29:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没放弃 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't give up, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.59,0:29:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 我不喜欢草草收场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…I hate loose ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.14,0:29:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也讨厌那些不屈不挠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hate people who don't know when to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.93,0:29:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.06,0:29:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,神勇的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spirited lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.35,0:29:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.81,0:29:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that autopsy report on my desk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.52,0:29:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 验尸报告 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- first thing tomorrow. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.94,0:29:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你能找到的任何关于巴克利太太的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anything you can find out about Mrs. Barclay and her son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.73,0:29:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 还有事吗 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it. Anything else I can do for you, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.49,0:29:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 还有这个 这个拿到实验室去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Here. Get this to the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在厨房角落找到它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it in the corner of the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.99,0:29:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.08,0:29:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是凶器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible murder weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.54,0:29:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.62,0:29:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You're kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.46,0:29:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你在开玩笑 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you are kidding me, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.76,0:29:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她看见你能走路和说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause she saw you walking and talking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.27,0:30:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜她无处可藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess there was no hiding from her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.49,0:30:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你在跟谁说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, who are you talking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.49,0:30:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.59,0:30:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.21,0:30:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.22,0:30:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就坐在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sitting right over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.93,0:30:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇还跟你说话 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky's been talking to you, too, hasn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.89,0:30:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he been saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.14,0:30:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All kinds of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.77,0:30:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的真名叫查尔斯·李·雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}His real name is Charles Lee Ray, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.27,0:30:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂里的爸爸命令它下凡来和我一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's been sent down from heaven by Daddy to play with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.03,0:31:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？还有其它事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has, has he? Anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.41,0:31:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他说玛吉阿姨是婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. He said Aunt Maggie was a real bitch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.25,0:31:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会遭到报应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got what she deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.88,0:31:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你怎么可以说这些可怕的事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, how can you say something so horrible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.84,0:31:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我说的 是恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say it. Chucky did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.09,0:31:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.80,0:31:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里清楚这是你编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know perfectly well that you're making this up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.97,0:31:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有 恰奇是活的 真的 他是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not. Chucky's alive. Really, he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.14,0:31:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 恰奇？恰奇是个公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, Chucky… Chucky's a doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.69,0:31:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是一些塑料和填充剂做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's made of plastic and stuffing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.85,0:31:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧它 瞧瞧它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him. Look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.48,0:31:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他像是其它东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, does he look like anything else to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.53,0:31:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 你会伤到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, you'll hurt him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.24,0:31:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.61,0:31:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真的以为恰奇是活着的吧 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you don't really think that Chucky is alive, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.99,0:31:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.49,0:31:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 别说了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, stop it. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.08,0:31:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为玛吉阿姨死了 你才这样的 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 'cause of Aunt Maggie you're yelling at me, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.71,0:31:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我猜是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, I guess it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.55,0:32:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.30,0:32:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再编故事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stop making up stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.43,0:32:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, champ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.69,0:32:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚想和我一起睡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna sleep in with me tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.81,0:32:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.19,0:32:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.78,0:32:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, into bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.87,0:32:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.30,0:32:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.93,0:32:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 恰奇 她不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, Chucky. She didn't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.03,0:33:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我喜欢被抱着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I like to be hugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.45,0:33:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我也喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'd love to hug you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.72,0:33:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.72,0:33:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确信昨晚没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're all right about last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.01,0:33:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有发关于玛吉阿姨的恶梦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bad dreams about Aunt Maggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.02,0:33:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇只是个公仔 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Chucky's only a doll, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.35,0:33:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快去学校 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, off to school with you, then. I love you tons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.72,0:34:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,43号街 下一站47号街\N{\fnArial\fs30}43rd street. Next stop, 47th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.11,0:35:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是艾迪的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Eddie's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.95,0:35:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在这里 我去尿尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you stay here. I have to go tinkle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.30,0:36:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在这里的 恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.59,0:37:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.56,0:38:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.96,0:38:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.66,0:39:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利太太？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.99,0:39:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺里斯探员 我刚收到你的消息就过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Norris, I came as soon as I got your message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.95,0:39:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没去学校接你儿子吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been to the school to pick up your son yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.54,0:39:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我直接从工作的地方过来的 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I came directly from work. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.33,0:39:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,进我办公室说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go into my office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.09,0:39:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something wrong with Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.34,0:39:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.26,0:39:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.60,0:39:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么说才好 巴克利太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to tell you this, Mrs. Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.77,0:39:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.31,0:39:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你的玛吉阿姨为什么会从窗户那摔下去的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea why your Aunt Maggie fell out of that window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.77,0:39:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.02,0:39:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我为什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you tell me why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她看到了恰奇 被吓坏了 然后就掉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause she saw Chucky, and it scared her so much, she fell out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.49,0:40:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she did, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.70,0:40:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么恰奇要去见艾迪·卡普托呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did Chucky go to see Eddie Caputo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.62,0:40:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.95,0:40:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.54,0:40:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 宝贝 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sweetheart. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.09,0:40:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen to me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.22,0:40:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会相信你是恰奇干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody believes you about Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.72,0:40:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你现在就说真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you start telling the truth right now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.06,0:40:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想把你从我身边弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to take you away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.39,0:40:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了没 恰奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.10,0:40:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话吧 不然他们要把你弄走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're taking me away unless you say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.99,0:40:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 说话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.49,0:40:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 恰奇 说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Chucky. Say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.33,0:40:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我为什么你一切都骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why you lied to me about everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.91,0:40:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 恰奇 说话呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Chucky. Say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.50,0:40:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.17,0:40:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是恰奇 我会是你永远的好朋友 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Chucky, and I'm your friend to the end. Hidey-ho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.17,0:41:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 他是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, he's doing it on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.05,0:41:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说过我不能泄露他的秘密 否则他会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me never to tell about him or he'd kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.52,0:41:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利太太 我是阿得莫 来自县城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Barclay, my name is Dr. Ardmore. I'm from County General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.44,0:41:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen more than enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.81,0:41:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许安迪应该跟我们一起待几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Andy should spend a couple of days with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.48,0:42:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊 你个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, say something, you little bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.82,0:42:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something, damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.91,0:42:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我喜欢被人拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I like to be hugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.87,0:42:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要你成为他最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He wants you for a best friend."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.58,0:42:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.30,0:43:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是恰奇 想和我一起玩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Chucky. Wanna play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.99,0:45:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.83,0:45:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 讲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.17,0:45:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说跟我说话 该死 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, talk to me, damn it. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.46,0:45:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你出声的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm gonna make you talk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.35,0:45:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊 否则我把你扔到火里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said talk to me, damn it, or else I am gonna throw you in the fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.19,0:45:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这蠢婊子 你这荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid bitch! You filthy slut!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.94,0:45:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你和我做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll teach you to fuck with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.57,0:45:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.57,0:46:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.81,0:46:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.78,0:46:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.83,0:47:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 诺里斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Detective Norris!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.79,0:47:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利太太 你在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Barclay, what are you doing back here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.58,0:47:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪说的是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy was telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.13,0:47:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇是活物 他杀死了艾迪·卡普托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky is alive and he killed Eddie Caputo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.63,0:47:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 我把他带回公寓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I took him home to my apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.71,0:47:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把装他的盒子扔掉 突然电池从里面掉出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to throw away the box that he came in when the batteries fell out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.68,0:47:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还没发现吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.84,0:47:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不用电池就可以活动还有说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been moving and talking for days without any batteries in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.22,0:47:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.52,0:47:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说我是如何发现这公仔是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I found out the doll was alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.31,0:47:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我威胁把他扔到火堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I threatened to throw him into the fireplace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.77,0:47:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然他就活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all of a sudden, he came alive in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.44,0:47:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扔下他 而他则跑出了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped him, and he got up and ran out of the apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.32,0:47:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 巴克利太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Mrs. Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.07,0:47:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我在告诉你事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I am telling you the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.24,0:47:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了玛吉 他杀了艾迪·卡普托\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Maggie. He killed Eddie Caputo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.99,0:47:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 巴克利太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mrs. Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.49,0:47:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很同情你 我真的很同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sympathize with you. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.41,0:47:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌今天所发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated what happened in there today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.33,0:47:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是撒谎对你儿子没好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But lying is not gonna help your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.12,0:47:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说谎？我像是在说谎吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying? Does this look like I'm lying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.09,0:47:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么被咬的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.17,0:47:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky bit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.42,0:47:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.26,0:48:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.89,0:48:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.01,0:48:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.43,0:48:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.72,0:48:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去找把恰奇卖给我的那个小贩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought him from a peddler where I work. I'll start there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.14,0:48:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里晚上治安很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}That isn't a good part of town to be in at this time of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.10,0:48:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克利太太 你听到了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Barclay, do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.69,0:48:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在晚上这个时候你不会要去那吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to go down there at this time of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.28,0:48:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.92,0:49:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.11,0:49:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.95,0:49:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.11,0:49:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.50,0:49:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你的 还记得我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you. Do you remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.29,0:49:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.33,0:49:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我昨天向你买了一只公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I bought a doll from you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.54,0:49:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我朋友一起在卡尔森商店后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}in back of Carson's department store with my friend yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.79,0:50:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 公仔？ - 是的 公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doll? - Yes, a Good Guy doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.75,0:50:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你卖给我的 还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold it to me. Do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.63,0:50:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 公仔 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, a doll. What about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.47,0:50:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里搞到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.13,0:50:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你的话你会给我什么好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you give me if I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.35,0:50:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我钱不多 有的都给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have much, but you're welcome to whatever I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.85,0:50:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够 你还有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not enough. What else you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.27,0:50:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.48,0:50:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.98,0:50:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.32,0:50:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你所有身家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not all you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.99,0:50:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 不 你还有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute. - No, you got a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.53,0:50:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没有 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.78,0:50:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等一下 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Wait. No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.95,0:50:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.83,0:50:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 他是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, he's a cop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.12,0:50:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们几个也想试试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What about the rest of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.17,0:50:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也想来聚一聚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna party, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.42,0:50:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可以告诉这位女士了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Now, you want to answer the lady's question now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.97,0:50:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里搞到那公仔的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get the doll from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.97,0:50:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know nothing about no doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.72,0:50:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna know nothing about nothing in a minute, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.56,0:50:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我 说\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you talk to me. Now talk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.02,0:50:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,华比区一个被烧毁了的玩具店 我在那里得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A burned-out toy store on Wabash. That's where I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.77,0:51:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.36,0:51:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.32,0:51:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.28,0:51:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那小贩说了些什么让你这么沮丧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, wait a minute. Something the peddler said upset you. What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.87,0:51:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just told you, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.04,0:51:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼了 我儿子很危险 究竟是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it. My son's life is at stake. Now, what was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.67,0:51:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他拿到公仔的地方 查尔斯·李·雷就是死在那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place where he said he got the doll, Charles Lee Ray died there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.71,0:51:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.88,0:51:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那杀人犯和艾迪·卡普托是搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lake Shore Strangler. The man who's partners with Eddie Caputo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.05,0:51:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Where are you going now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.51,0:51:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,华比和范拜仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wabash and Van Buren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.64,0:51:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里什么都没有 那家店已经毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing there. It's an abandoned wreck of a store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.14,0:51:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.27,0:51:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·李·雷死时 那里被闪电击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was struck by lightning the night that Charles Lee Ray died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.73,0:51:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在那 是我杀死他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was there. I was the man who killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.66,0:51:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.45,0:51:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会把这种事告诉别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not exactly the kind of thing you tell someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.25,0:52:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我送你回家 你需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let me take you home. You need some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.84,0:52:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了什么吗？随便什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say anything? Anything at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.42,0:52:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 查尔斯·李·雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Charles Lee Ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.67,0:52:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊 他威胁要杀了我和艾迪·卡普托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He threatened to kill me and Eddie Caputo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.40,0:52:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉你没能找到什么可以救安迪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you couldn't find anything to help Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.44,0:52:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.11,0:52:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.32,0:52:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现恰奇就是查尔斯·李·雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out that Chucky is Charles Lee Ray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.16,0:52:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一不知道的是他怎样进入那公仔里面去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I don't know is how he got inside the doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.79,0:52:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 巴克利夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Mrs. Barclay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.91,0:52:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·李·雷住哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did Charles Lee Ray live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.54,0:52:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你能不能下车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, please, will you just get out of the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.00,0:52:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他住在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just tell me where he lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.88,0:52:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗？安迪的性命跟这个关系很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand? Andy's life depends on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.21,0:52:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯托岛730号 南部\N{\fnArial\fs30}730 Stoney Island, the south side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.92,0:52:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've already checked the place out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.51,0:52:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里什么也没有 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing there. Now, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.05,0:52:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.93,0:53:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回家 休息一会 - 你不能那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Home, to get some sleep. - No, you can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.10,0:53:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白？你刚刚说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see? You just said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.64,0:53:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇杀了卡普托 你很吃惊吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky killed Caputo. That leaves you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.15,0:53:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.19,0:53:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.99,0:53:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.07,0:53:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在告诉你事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am telling you the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.49,0:53:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.66,0:53:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很理智 巴克利夫人 理智而且清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm sane, Mrs. Barclay. Sane and rational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.75,0:53:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.66,0:53:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得你遇到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember what you said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.79,0:53:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个晚上说过的话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the first night you met me in my apartment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.13,0:53:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你不喜欢悲惨的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about it? - You said you didn't like loose ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.00,0:53:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经很惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm a loose end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.09,0:53:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在查清楚这件事前你别想让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just let go what I said tonight without checking it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.01,0:53:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次 巴克利夫人 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the last time, Mrs. Barclay, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.48,0:54:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.71,0:55:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.83,0:55:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.93,0:56:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 麦琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.23,0:56:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做没用 麦琪 你伤不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't do you any good, Mikey. You can't hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.00,0:58:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.92,0:59:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.47,0:59:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我昨晚跟你说过话后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I talked to you last night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.18,0:59:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定回到局里并翻阅了雷的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to go back to the station and pull Ray's file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.06,0:59:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned a couple of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.77,0:59:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷的小名就叫恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nickname was Chucky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.02,0:59:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟这个男人混了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he spent a lot of time with this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.90,0:59:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做的就是在恰奇之前先找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, all we have to do is find him before Chucky does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.92,0:59:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.46,0:59:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.88,0:59:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.84,0:59:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.63,0:59:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认为？符咒的作用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? The grigri work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.06,0:59:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我之前来学习驱鬼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I came here learning all that stuff about how to beat death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.27,1:00:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能觉得我还是个小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe you were pulling my chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.94,1:00:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在不是了 现在不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not now. Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.32,1:00:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.94,1:00:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.90,1:00:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我不认为有人能伤到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This. I didn't think anybody could hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.28,1:00:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但昨晚我被枪击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But last night, I got shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.03,1:00:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something? It hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.24,1:00:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的受伤了 甚至流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurt like a son of a bitch. It even bled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.62,1:00:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这样 约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why's that, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.00,1:00:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在转变为人类吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're turning human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.42,1:00:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.42,1:00:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你寄居在身体上的时间越长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more time you spend in that body, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.38,1:00:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就越来越向人类转变\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more human you'll become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.97,1:00:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意思是我以后都得生存在这身体里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean I have to live out the rest of my life in this body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.81,1:00:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门 你把我弄到里面去 就得把我弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fucking way. You got me into this, you get me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.10,1:00:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.86,1:00:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.52,1:00:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你很讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're an abomination, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.99,1:00:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的暴行违背了天理\N{\fnArial\fs30}an outrage against nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.82,1:00:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扭曲了我教你做的全部事情把它用于邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You perverted everything I've taught you and used it for evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.37,1:00:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须被阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have to be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.00,1:01:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我早就想到类似这样的事情可能会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I thought something like this might happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.96,1:01:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I prepared for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.71,1:01:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.80,1:01:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己的魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own personal mojo, doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.30,1:01:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.43,1:01:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你想要什么样的？断了腿的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. How do you want it? Broken leg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.14,1:01:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不应该告诉你的顾客这种东西藏在哪里 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't tell your customers where you hide things like this, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.35,1:01:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都让你陷入麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets you in trouble every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.81,1:01:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎样才能离开这身子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now how do I get out of this body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.44,1:01:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I won't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.49,1:01:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.99,1:01:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我或者去死 约翰 你选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me or die, John. Your choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.70,1:01:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.33,1:01:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把你的灵魂传出那个公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to transfer your soul out of the doll{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.71,1:01:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给第一个看到你真面目的人体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}into that of the first human being you revealed your true self to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.21,1:01:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说只要传给第一个知道我是活的人就行了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the first person I let in on the fact that I was really alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.97,1:01:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信 真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it. I just don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.97,1:02:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个知道我秘密的是一个6岁的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first person I let in on my little secret was a six-year-old kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又要变成一个6岁的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be six years old again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.85,1:02:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 真有趣 但我会干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, John, it's been fun, but I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.03,1:02:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那小孩还有约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a date with a six-year-old boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.82,1:02:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你则和死神有约\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have a date with death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.37,1:02:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.23,1:02:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.95,1:02:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.87,1:03:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太迟了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Too late. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.54,1:03:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要救那小孩 一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must save the boy. Must…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.84,1:03:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须把他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must get his soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.67,1:03:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进他的身体就像他进入公仔的身体里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}into him like he got into doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.88,1:03:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.63,1:03:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在他唱出圣歌前阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must stop him before he can say the chant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.72,1:03:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他说出来前杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him before he can say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.77,1:03:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要怎样做？怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how? How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.19,1:03:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏 他的心几乎是人类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart. His heart is almost human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.82,1:03:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的方法 穿过心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way. Through the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.96,1:03:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 救我 阿得莫医生 恰奇在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me! Dr. Ardmore, Chucky's here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.98,1:04:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 他要来杀我 在这里 恰奇在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! He's coming to kill me! He's here. Chucky's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.48,1:04:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.99,1:04:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是医生 恰奇在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Doctor, Chucky's here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.53,1:04:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's going to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.99,1:04:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰奇在这里 他要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Chucky is here, and he's going to kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.67,1:04:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.17,1:04:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别丢下我 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.23,1:05:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.02,1:05:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.07,1:05:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.23,1:05:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.58,1:05:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,查一下北面的走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the north corridor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.80,1:06:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 放松 没事的 安迪 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Easy, it's all right, Andy. It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.67,1:06:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也不需要它了 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna need this anymore, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.22,1:06:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要 恰奇在房里 他想要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do. Chucky's in the room, and he's trying to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.81,1:06:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 安迪 没事的 我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Andy. It's gonna be all right. I'm here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.31,1:06:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.64,1:06:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 放松 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy. Easy, boy. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.56,1:07:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, nobody's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.31,1:07:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别这样 他也会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. He'll kill you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.98,1:07:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.15,1:07:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 请听我说 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. Listen to me. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.32,1:07:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只会让你疼一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, now this is just gonna sting you for one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.84,1:07:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.35,1:07:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.91,1:07:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.20,1:07:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你能离开一会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, miss, could you just excuse us for a minute here, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.54,1:07:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.79,1:08:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.00,1:08:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放到那机器里面炸成薯片 但他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fried him to a crisp with the electric shock machine and then he escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.34,1:08:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑了？哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escaped? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.05,1:08:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不知道 但我想她知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know, but I bet she does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.56,1:08:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恰奇 你见过恰奇吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky. You seen Chucky anywhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.81,1:08:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁是恰奇？ - 一个公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's Chucky? - Kid's doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.69,1:08:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟局里那个是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same one that was at the station house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.15,1:08:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen him anywhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.86,1:08:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道一个公仔？你们去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I gonna know about a doll? Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.24,1:08:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为是安迪干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think Andy did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.40,1:08:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 那女孩说恰奇在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, the girl said that Chucky was here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.16,1:08:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,找安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that he was looking for Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.87,1:08:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪能去哪呢？ - 家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But where would Andy go? - He'd go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.70,1:08:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说去那里如果他有麻烦的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always told him to go there if he was in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.41,1:08:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有钥匙吗？ - 在门毯下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does he have a key? - It's under the mat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.37,1:08:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 我们没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. We don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.77,1:09:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.07,1:09:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些小孩把他们的公仔扔在了电梯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some child left their doll in the elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.07,1:09:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.15,1:09:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些扔了公仔的小孩会回来找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever left it there will come back looking for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.37,1:09:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真丑的公仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugly doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.67,1:09:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.65,1:11:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃惊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.05,1:11:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,打啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batter up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.31,1:12:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我力量吧 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.79,1:12:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.17,1:12:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪 - 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy! - Andy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.96,1:12:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 你能听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.05,1:13:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.31,1:13:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.81,1:13:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.19,1:13:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.86,1:13:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 凯伦 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, Karen, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.28,1:13:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.53,1:13:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take care of Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.66,1:13:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, Karen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.79,1:13:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.04,1:13:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.42,1:13:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.77,1:14:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？卡壳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Gun jammed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.48,1:15:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.69,1:15:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 救我 火柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, help me. The matches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.82,1:15:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.15,1:15:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.50,1:15:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, no, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.59,1:15:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是永远的好朋友 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're friends to the end. Remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.50,1:15:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the end, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.26,1:16:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.76,1:16:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦？安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen? Andy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.10,1:16:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.94,1:16:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 帮我拿点急救包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, go get me the first-aid kit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.61,1:16:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在厨房水槽下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the kitchen sink really fast. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.74,1:16:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.90,1:16:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 恰奇已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Chucky's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.75,1:17:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 恰奇跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, Chucky's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.51,1:17:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.59,1:17:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.07,1:17:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.15,1:17:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.41,1:17:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.62,1:17:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那男孩给我 我不杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the boy, and I'll let you live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.79,1:17:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了没 把他给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me? Give me the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.98,1:18:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.98,1:18:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把小孩交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.59,1:19:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里究竟发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.05,1:19:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.72,1:19:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.26,1:20:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.93,1:20:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.36,1:20:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警员倒下了 多处刀伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got a cop down here. Multiple stab wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.28,1:20:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,北格兰街的部鲁斯特区 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brewster Apartments on North Grand Street. Make it fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.99,1:20:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们10分钟内到 发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, they're gonna be here in 10 minutes. Now, tell me what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.62,1:20:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小孩说对了 公仔是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid was right. The doll's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.58,1:20:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他几乎把我们3人都困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He almost got the three of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.16,1:20:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正经点 你胡说什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, what are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.87,1:20:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不信？继续到大厅里检查下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me? All right, well, go on. Check it out in the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.33,1:20:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能在这厅里的任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's scattered all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.00,1:20:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别碰它 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't touch it. Do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.46,1:20:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰它任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you touch one part of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.92,1:20:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look. Take it easy, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.84,1:20:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax yourself, all right? All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.84,1:21:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 我想你去看看这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mike. I'd like you to take a look at this thing, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.55,1:21:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那东西不可能还是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there's no way this thing's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.60,1:21:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I told you not to touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.06,1:21:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 理智点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, will you be sensible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.85,1:21:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 就像死了一样 它死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, look. It's as dead as they come. It's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.02,1:21:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choke him! Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.19,1:21:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拧断他的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll rip his throat out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.86,1:21:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.45,1:21:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.74,1:21:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 扼死他 别让他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him now! Strangle him! Don't let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.05,1:22:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.81,1:22:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们 杀了他们 杀光他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them! Kill them! Kill them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.85,1:22:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏 射他的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart. Shoot him in the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.59,1:22:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是恰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.92,1:22:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.94,1:22:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在相信我了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:22:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.36,1:23:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有谁信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who's gonna believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.57,1:23:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.79,1:23:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？好了没？走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Ready? Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.96,1:23:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.48,1:23:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.68,1:23:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我们和迈克一起去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We're gonna go to the hospital with Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.27,1:23:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
